load @term/seed/code/structure/ring
  find ring

# The Connes-Kreimer algebra: the Hopf algebra of rooted trees that organizes the renormalization of quantum field
# theory, turning the recursive subtraction of infinities into an algebraic operation (the antipode). It revealed that
# renormalization, long seen as a physicist's trick, is a clean piece of Hopf-algebra mathematics. The form carries the
# underlying ring of rooted-tree combinations.
form connes-kreimer-algebra
  link ring, like ring
